                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Example: Configuring the "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "UseLocalVgtid"
                        }
                      ],
                      "kind": "monospace",
                      "roles": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": " SMT"
                    }
                  ],
                  "sections": []
                }
              ],
              "title": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Table of Contents"
                }
              ]
            },
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "UseLocalVgtid"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " SMT converts the value of the VGTID in the event record from a list of VGTIDs for several shards to the VGTID for the single shard that received the change for this event. This transformation is designed for use only with the Debezium connector for Vitess."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The SMT extracts the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "shard"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " field in the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "source"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " block of the transaction boundary event record to determine the shard that received the change. The SMT then sets that value of the VGTID in the event record to the value of the VGTID for the specified shard. Other VGTID values are removed from the event record. The following example shows how to add the SMT to the connector configuration so that it converts lists of the VGTIDs for multiple shards to the value of a single local VGTID."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "\"connector.class\": \"io.debezium.connector.vitess.VitessConnector\",\n...\n\"transforms\": \"useLocalVgtid\",\n\"transforms.useLocalVgtid.type\": \"io.debezium.connector.vitess.transforms.UseLocalVgtid\",\n..."
              }
            ],
            "language": null,
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The following example shows the value of a record before and after the transformation is applied."
